			+ "the save as valid, with no error and no warning"
		IMPL "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section0-player-progression.schema.json::\"logisticsPaused\""
	SPEC "the merged save carries the logisticsPaused of save A when save A has it, otherwise the"
		+ "one of save B, and no logisticsPaused when neither save has it"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/rules/merge/mergeGlobalMetadata.spec.ts::should keep"
			+ "the logistics pause state from save A"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/rules/merge/mergeGlobalMetadata.spec.ts::should keep"
			+ "the logistics pause state from save B"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/rules/merge/mergeGlobalMetadata.spec.ts::should"
			+ "write the metadata entry with no logisticsPaused key"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/rules/merge/mergeGlobalMetadata.ts::...(logisticsPaused"
			+ "=== undefined ? {} : {logisticsPaused})"
	SPEC "a merge of two saves that carry no logisticsPaused produces the same bytes as before the"
		+ "task"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/rules/merge/mergeGlobalMetadata.spec.ts::should"
			+ "write the metadata entry with no logisticsPaused key"
	DELIVERED_BY 111
	WAVE 5
	RATIONALE "The Skeo update is game release 2.102; release 2.103 is its first patch and changes"
		+ "no save key. The only key the update adds is logisticsPaused in the global metadata, the"
		+ "state of the drone button stop and recall all drones, written as false on save and"
		+ "absent from saves written before 2.102. The closed section 0 schema rejects it and the"
		+ "global metadata merge would drop it. logisticsPaused is arbitrated like the open"
		+ "instance fields, save A winning, so that a merge of saves written before 2.102 keeps the"
		+ "output whose checksum the verification protocol records. The rest of the Skeo support is"
		+ "split into the other tasks of wave 5, each delivered by its own pull request"
