		+ "ruling was taken and never as the source of the task it delivers, the PULL_REQUEST"
		+ "entity among its REJECTED"
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/decisions.awawa::DECISION"
			+ "APullRequestIsCitedByItsNumberNeverByAnEntity"
