		IMPL "agents/corpus-ecrire.md::née dans une pull request porte son numéro dans son champ"
		IMPL "agents/pull-request.md::le numéro de la PR, jamais une entité"
	SPEC "no DECISION or PROCESS argues from SOURCE.REF being required"
		IMPL "docs/awawa-project-methodology/decisions.awawa::NAME version_segment validates its"
			+ "shape"
	SPEC "the AGENTS.md command run before implementing or specifying passes --skip provenance"
		IMPL "AGENTS.md::--skip reasoning --skip provenance --with-schema"
	SPEC "no DESC of docs/_schema.awawa and no line of agents/ names a retention delay for the"
		+ "archive"
		IMPL "docs/_schema.awawa::the day the entity was archived"
		IMPL "agents/pull-request.md::revient à la passe de nettoyage, pas à la PR"
	RATIONALE "The review of pull request 101 raised that one PULL_REQUEST entity per cited pull"
		+ "request duplicates the repository log; refined with the user on 2026-09-21, the"
		+ "duplication is the entity, not the citation. Measured on master b2f48f5: the 51 entities"
		+ "hold a NUMBER their name repeats and a DESC copying the pull request title, 47 of them"
		+ "written at once by the migration of pull request 95; 152 of the 154 SOURCE prose lines"
		+ "citing them say who ruled, when and what, which git does not hold; and the number is not"
		+ "derivable from git, the log of master carrying (#n) on 18 commits of 158 and git log -S"
		+ "returning the migration for a ruling taken in pull request 62. The number therefore"
