TASK FEAT65
	TITLE "Place the world objects and world events of Skeo on Skeo"
	STATUS implemented
	SPEC "a world object or a world event carrying the planet numeric id -440810600 is placed on"
		+ "Skeo"
		IMPL "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/planetNamesByNumericId.json::-440810600"
	WAVE 5
	DELIVERED_BY 112
	RATIONALE "Skeo, added by game release 2.102, is the planet whose id -440810600 is missing from"
		+ "the planet table; the stable hash of the planet name gives it, as it gives the five rows"
		+ "already there. Without the row the planet name is guessed from the group ids of the"
		+ "world objects placed on it, and the energy section falls back to its unnamed planet"
