TASK FEAT89
	TITLE "Warn when a save contradicts the game release it declares"
	STATUS todo
	WAVE 5
	AFTER @TASK.DOCS86
	SPEC "the releases HOLDS_FOR names are a table beside the module that reads it, one row per"
		+ "release with what the code tells apart in the saves it writes, the number of parts today"
	SPEC "the version a save configuration declares resolves to the last release of the table not"
		+ "later than it"
	SPEC "a save is read by what it carries; when that contradicts the release its version resolves"
		+ "to, loading it raises a warning naming both, and the save is still read"
	SPEC "a save declaring 2.004 or later and carrying the Terrain Layers section raises that"
		+ "warning, and so does a save declaring 1.618 or earlier without it"
	SPEC "the scenario fixtures declare the version of a release whose format they carry"
	RATIONALE "The code tells the two formats apart by the number of parts alone and never reads"
		+ "the version the save declares, so a hand edit that makes them disagree goes unreported."
		+ "The table is the mechanism FEAT68 extends with the release that removed a group id,"
		+ "instead of a second list of versions. Every scenario fixture declares version 1.0 today,"
		+ "which resolves to 1.618 while three of the four carry the format of 2.004"
		REF @DECISION.ASaveIsNeverDiscriminatedByItsVersionAlone
		REF @TASK.FEAT68
	SOURCE "The owner, 2026-09-22, while ruling the releases of HOLDS_FOR for DOCS86"
		REF @TASK.DOCS86

